    "appVersion": "0.1.0",
    "description": "2N3904-like transistor biased by 47 k/10 k from 12 V, RC = 4.7 kΩ, RE = 1 kΩ (unbypassed). Voltage gain ≈ −RC/RE ≈ −4.3 with the 100 kΩ load. Input 20 mV peak at 1 kHz."
